</td>
              </tr>
              <tr style="height: 35px;">
                <td style="width: 174px; height: 35px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Lateral rectus overaction</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 244.656px; height: 35px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Enhanced lateral rectus tone or contracture</p>
</td>
