</td>
                <td style="width: 242.948px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>MyoD, myogenin &#x02191;; BDNF &#x02193;</p>
</td>
                <td style="width: 227px;" rowspan="1" colspan="1">
<p>Muscle plasticity with reduced trophic support</p>
</td>
              </tr>
            </tbody>
